Problem: Xiaopang uses two stopwatches to measure the speed of a train. He finds that the train takes 40 seconds to pass through a 660-meter bridge and takes 10 seconds to pass by him at the same speed. Based on the data provided by Xiaopang, calculate the length of the train in meters.

